<p> </p>

<p style="line-height:1.6;">Open NJ allows faculty and students to find Open Educational Resources (OER) adopted at participating New Jersey institutions and materials created by the <a href="<%BASEURL%>otc">Open Textbook Collaborative</a> grant.  By creating this common space, Open NJ enables faculty to share OER, expand their knowledge of adopted OER, and identify OER for their potential adoption. (<a href="<%BASEURL%>info/aboutopennj">learn more</a> <!--<a href="<%BASEURL%>browseby">browse by metadata</a>--> )</p>

<!--<p>Reported cost savings as of August 2020: $210,101,579 (based on 22 institutions).</p>-->


